{
	"title": "Compléter une branche d'un arbre pondéré",
	"description": "Arbre à deux niveaux dont une pondération manque : la somme des branches issues d'un même nœud vaut 1",
	"grades": ["2"],
	"points": ["2-178", "2-183"],
	"theme": "Probabilités",
	"domain": "Probabilités conditionnelles",
	"subdomain": "Arbres pondérés",
	"level": 1,
	"status": "draft",
	"delay": 30,
	"shared": {
		"blankDefaults": {
			"acceptDecimal": true
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "On considère l'arbre pondéré ci-dessous.\n\n```probtree\nA:0.{{a}}\n  B:0.{{b}}\n  \\overline{B}:0.{{eval:10-b}}\n\\overline{A}:?\n  B:0.{{c}}\n  \\overline{B}:0.{{eval:10-c}}\n```\n\nDonne la pondération manquante, en fraction irréductible.\n\n$P(\\overline{A})=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "1..9"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["a != 5", "b != c"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:1-a/10}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"La somme des probabilités des branches issues d'un même nœud vaut $1$.",
					"$P(\\overline{A})=1-P(A)=1-0.{{a}}=0.{{eval:10-a}}$, soit ${{eval:1-a/10}}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "On considère l'arbre pondéré ci-dessous.\n\n```probtree\nA:0.{{a}}\n  B:0.{{t}}{{u}}\n  \\overline{B}:?\n\\overline{A}:0.{{eval:10-a}}\n  B:0.{{c}}\n  \\overline{B}:0.{{eval:10-c}}\n```\n\nDonne la pondération manquante, en fraction irréductible.\n\n$P_A(\\overline{B})=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "t",
					"expression": "1..8"
				},
				{
					"name": "u",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "1..9"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["u != 5"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:1-(10*t+u)/100}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Les deux branches issues du nœud $A$ portent $P_A(B)$ et $P_A(\\overline{B})$ : leur somme vaut $1$.",
					"$P_A(\\overline{B})=1-P_A(B)=1-0.{{t}}{{u}}=0.{{eval:9-t}}{{eval:10-u}}$, soit ${{eval:1-(10*t+u)/100}}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "On considère l'arbre pondéré ci-dessous.\n\n```probtree\nA:{{n}}/{{d}}\n  B:{{r}}/{{s}}\n  \\overline{B}:{{eval:s-r}}/{{s}}\n\\overline{A}:{{eval:d-n}}/{{d}}\n  B:{{m}}/{{q}}\n  \\overline{B}:?\n```\n\nDonne la pondération manquante, en fraction irréductible.\n\n$P_{\\overline{A}}(\\overline{B})=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "d",
					"expression": "3..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "1..8"
				},
				{
					"name": "s",
					"expression": "3..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "1..8"
				},
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "3..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "m",
					"expression": "1..8"
				}
			],
			"conditions": [
				"n < d",
				"gcd(n, d) = 1",
				"r < s",
				"gcd(r, s) = 1",
				"m < q",
				"gcd(m, q) = 1",
				"2*m != q",
				"q != s"
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(q-m)/q}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Les deux branches issues du nœud $\\overline{A}$ portent $P_{\\overline{A}}(B)$ et $P_{\\overline{A}}(\\overline{B})$ : leur somme vaut $1$.",
					"$P_{\\overline{A}}(\\overline{B})=1-P_{\\overline{A}}(B)=1-\\dfrac{ {{m}} }{ {{q}} }=\\dfrac{ {{eval:q-m}} }{ {{q}} }$."
				]
			}
		}
	],
